<title>CHINA: China Jan-May gasoline output down 2.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>China Jan-May gasoline output down 2.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China produced 13.3444 million tonnes of gasoline in the first five months, down by 2.8 percent compared with the year-ago period, said a report issued by the State Statistical Bureau on Monday.</p>
<p>China produced 2.6229 million tonnes of gasoline in May alone, the report said.</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532-1921</p>
</text>
